{"schemaVersion":1,"corpusId":"euclid-elements-heath-1908","status":"raw_machine","contentItem":{"id":"euclid-3-2","kind":"proposition","title":"圆界任取二点以直线相联则直线全在圆内","englishTitle":"If on the circumference of a circle two points be taken at random, the straight line joining the points will fall within the circle.","book":3,"number":2,"status":"raw_machine","sourceMissing":false,"source":{"urn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:3.prop.2","url":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:3.prop.2/","group":"prop","sourceNumber":2,"corpusSha256":"ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c","hasSourceFigure":true,"historicalChineseUrl":"https://zh.wikisource.org/zh-hans/幾何原本/卷三"}},"revision":{"id":"euclid-3-2@raw-444c411d6133ec49","contentId":"euclid-3-2","version":1,"status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"444c411d6133ec49c455de11e7114abf2ce6d6fcbc314c39afe2a2e985abc34f","createdBy":"mathforge-corpus-import","changeSummary":"Imported Heath source and machine-assisted Chinese draft. No mathematical or editorial review is implied.","blockIds":["euclid-3-2.statement","euclid-3-2.construction.1","euclid-3-2.proof.1","euclid-3-2.proof.2","euclid-3-2.proof.3","euclid-3-2.proof.4","euclid-3-2.proof.5","euclid-3-2.conclusion","euclid-3-2.historical.1","euclid-3-2.source"]},"blocks":[{"id":"euclid-3-2.statement","contentId":"euclid-3-2","revisionId":"euclid-3-2@raw-444c411d6133ec49","order":0,"kind":"statement","title":"命题陈述","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"2d3e6c19df68922653d8ea9f01a0bb7b4971568c285296f6d9c3b96ea6e4a4b8","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"If on the circumference of a circle two points be taken at random, the straight line joining the points will fall within the circle."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"如果在圆圈的环绕上随机取两点,连接点的直线将划入圆圈。"},{"id":"historical-zh","role":"historical_source","language":"zh-Hans","status":"source_transcription","text":"圜界任取二点以直线相联则直线全在圜内"},{"id":"historical-modern-zh","role":"historical_machine_interpretation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"如果圆上的任意两点通过直线连接，则所有直线都在圆内部。"}]},{"id":"euclid-3-2.construction.1","contentId":"euclid-3-2","revisionId":"euclid-3-2@raw-444c411d6133ec49","order":1,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"8958c563ba41573af1331879ead44268ca0df2d1d6492894c07715502182b3bb","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let ABC be a circle, and let two points A, B be taken at random on its circumference; I say that the straight line joined from A to B will fall within the circle."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"让ABC圆圈,让2个点A,B 随机地在圆圈上走;我说,连接A至B的直线将属于圆圈。"}]},{"id":"euclid-3-2.proof.1","contentId":"euclid-3-2","revisionId":"euclid-3-2@raw-444c411d6133ec49","order":2,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"4ce86ff9e03cb72745325b57ca5d10367c39a58800186f0cf82adf41f6ff16db","citations":["euclid-3-1"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For suppose it does not, but, if possible, let it fall outside, as AEB; let the centre of the circle ABC be taken [[III. 1](/principles/euclid-3-1)], and let it be D; let DA, DB be joined, and let DFE be drawn through."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"假设它不会,但如果可能,让它落到外面,成为AEB;让ABC圈的中心被取走,让它成为D;让DA,DB连接,让DFE被拉过。 [[III. 1](/principles/euclid-3-1)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-3-2.proof.2","contentId":"euclid-3-2","revisionId":"euclid-3-2@raw-444c411d6133ec49","order":3,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"d1de615196238dcd6ee88051a3963731f1ae5c990865c8975c64ab82e5adc164","citations":["euclid-1-5","euclid-1-16"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Then, since DA is equal to DB, the angle DAE is also equal to the angle DBE. [[I. 5](/principles/euclid-1-5)] And, since one side AEB of the triangle DAE is produced, the angle DEB is greater than the angle DAE. [[I. 16](/principles/euclid-1-16)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"DA等于DB,DAE角度也等于DBE角度。而且,由于三角形DAE的一方AEB被延伸,DEB角度大于DAE角度。 [[I. 5](/principles/euclid-1-5)] [[I. 16](/principles/euclid-1-16)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-3-2.proof.3","contentId":"euclid-3-2","revisionId":"euclid-3-2@raw-444c411d6133ec49","order":4,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"dffed97de2522b865fd62bbb8e5f042cfb8f8d0e3d191460cfdbe5a03fc8ddb2","citations":["euclid-1-19"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But the angle DAE is equal to the angle DBE; therefore the angle DEB is greater than the angle DBE. And the greater angle is subtended by the greater side; [[I. 19](/principles/euclid-1-19)] therefore DB is greater than DE. But DB is equal to DF; therefore DF is greater than DE, the less than the greater : which is impossible."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但角度DAE等于角度DBE;因此角度DEB大于角度DBE。 较大数量角度被较大数量角度所分解; 因此, DB大于DE。 但DB等于DF; 因此, DF大于DE, 数量小于较大数量: 这是不可能做到的。 [[I. 19](/principles/euclid-1-19)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-3-2.proof.4","contentId":"euclid-3-2","revisionId":"euclid-3-2@raw-444c411d6133ec49","order":5,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 4","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"47cd3708c32835bf117a39577d1ecd0009234d74674c8e6020cc4548fb0d244f","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore the straight line joined from A to B will not fall outside the circle."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,连接A至B的直线不会在圆圈之外。"}]},{"id":"euclid-3-2.proof.5","contentId":"euclid-3-2","revisionId":"euclid-3-2@raw-444c411d6133ec49","order":6,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 5","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"e1649facbfdcd5b31d7402ae40950308ed2e825418136ce84dc289a70d205668","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Similarly we can prove that neither will it fall on the circumference itself; therefore it will fall within."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"同样,我们可以证明,它也不会相互相交,因此它会属于其中。"}]},{"id":"euclid-3-2.conclusion","contentId":"euclid-3-2","revisionId":"euclid-3-2@raw-444c411d6133ec49","order":7,"kind":"conclusion","title":"结论","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"d41f4fe56dd428c759377c807a93013dffbbe29c7596acfdac57dd182cad51b6","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore etc. Q. E. D."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,等等,证毕。"}]},{"id":"euclid-3-2.historical.1","contentId":"euclid-3-2","revisionId":"euclid-3-2@raw-444c411d6133ec49","order":8,"kind":"historical_note","title":"徐光启、利玛窦历史中译 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"e5e5349a0b0589c6927fc21daea2282131e85d63f21615be4931da6662c0c4fd","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"historical-zh","role":"historical_source","language":"zh-Hans","status":"source_transcription","text":"圜界任取二点以直线相联则直线全在圜内解曰甲乙丙圜界上任取甲丙二点作直线相聨题言甲丙线全在圜内论曰如云在外若甲丁丙线令寻取甲乙丙圜之戊心〈本篇一〉次作戊甲戊丙两直线次于甲丁丙线上作戊乙丁线而与圜界遇于乙即戊甲丁丙当为三角形以甲丁丙为底戊甲戊丙两腰等其戊甲丙戊丙甲两角宜等〈一卷五〉而戊丁甲为戊丙丁之外角宜大于戊丙丁角即亦宜大于戊甲丁角〈一卷十六〉则对戊丁甲大角之戊甲线宜大于戊丁线矣〈一卷十九〉夫戊甲与戊乙本同圜之半径等据如所论则戊乙亦大于戊丁不可通也若云不在圜外而在圜界依前论令戊甲大于戊乙亦不可通也"},{"id":"historical-modern-zh","role":"historical_machine_interpretation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"圆上任意两点用直线连接，则所有直线都在圆内。解释如下：甲乙丙 在圆上，任意两点 甲丙 用直线连接。命题解释 甲丙：所有直线都在圆内。证明如下：如果 甲丁丙 直线要找圆的 戊 圆心 甲乙丙，则在 甲丁丙 直线上画 戊乙丁 直线并在 乙 与圆周相交。戊甲丁丙 应构成一个三角形，以 甲丁丙 为底。戊甲戊丙 应有相等的腰。两个角 戊甲丙戊丙甲 应等于 〈一卷五〉，戊丁甲 应为 戊丙丁 的外角，也应大于 戊甲丁 角。然后对于 戊丁甲，戊甲 的大角应大于 戊丁 直线。〈一卷十九〉，由于 戊甲 和 戊乙 原本具有相同的圆半径且相等，戊乙 也大于 戊丁 且无法通过。如果云不在圆外而在圆周上，根据之前的论述，戊甲 也大于 戊丙丁，戊乙 也无法通过。"}]},{"id":"euclid-3-2.source","contentId":"euclid-3-2","revisionId":"euclid-3-2@raw-444c411d6133ec49","order":9,"kind":"source","title":"来源、译者与开放许可","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"3fca386c6bce23c9b59ae9fcda693f27346836e413835ddea0ccb6298de636fe","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"provenance","role":"provenance_note","language":"en","status":"generated_metadata","text":"Perseus / Heath source: https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:3.prop.2/\nCorpus URN: urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:3.prop.2\nCorpus SHA-256: ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c\nLicense: CC BY-SA 4.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/)\nHistorical Chinese source: https://zh.wikisource.org/zh-hans/幾何原本/卷三"}]}],"outgoingEdges":[{"id":"edge:euclid-3-2:euclid-3-1:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-3-2","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-3-2.proof.1"],"targetContentId":"euclid-3-1","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:3.prop.2","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:3.prop.2/","sourceLabel":"III. 1"}},{"id":"edge:euclid-3-2:euclid-1-5:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-3-2","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-3-2.proof.2"],"targetContentId":"euclid-1-5","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:3.prop.2","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:3.prop.2/","sourc